<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
	<Analysis>
		<Title>PHP, Node.js and Apache Installs from YARA-X Scan - Universal</Title>
		<Description><![CDATA[<P>Reports the results of the &quot;Scan for PHP, Node.js and Apache Installs with YARA-X&quot; tasks (macOS, Linux, Windows), every hour: the distinct PHP, Node.js, Electron, Apache and mod_http2 versions found, how many PHP, Node.js and Apache files were found (Node.js files include native addons, which have no version), and when the scan ran. Each computer's full list (&quot;path&lt;TAB&gt;product&lt;TAB&gt;version&quot; per product found in a file) is in __BESData/__Global/Logs/yara_results_runtimes.text. A computer that was scanned and has none of them reports 0 files.</P>]]></Description>
		<Relevance><![CDATA[exists files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Relevance>
		<Source>Internal</Source>
		<SourceID>jgstew</SourceID>
		<SourceReleaseDate>2026-11-13</SourceReleaseDate>
		<MIMEField>
			<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
			<Value>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:50:52 +0000</Value>
		</MIMEField>
		<Domain>BESC</Domain>
		<Property Name="PHP Versions Found" ID="1" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[unique values of following texts of firsts "%09php%09" of lines of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="PHP Files Found" ID="2" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[(number of unique values of preceding texts of firsts "%09php%09" of lines of it) of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Scan Time" ID="3" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[modification times of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Node.js Versions Found" ID="4" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[unique values of following texts of firsts "%09node%09" of lines of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Node.js Files Found" ID="5" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[(number of unique values of preceding texts of firsts "%09node%09" of lines of it) of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Electron Versions Found" ID="6" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[unique values of following texts of firsts "%09electron%09" of lines of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Apache Versions Found" ID="7" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[unique values of following texts of firsts "%09apache%09" of lines of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="Apache Files Found" ID="8" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[(number of unique values of preceding texts of firsts "%09apache%09" of lines of it) of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
		<Property Name="mod_http2 Versions Found" ID="9" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H"><![CDATA[unique values of following texts of firsts "%09mod_http2%09" of lines of files whose(name of it as lowercase starts with "yara_results_runtimes.text") of folders "Logs" of folders "__Global" of data folders of client]]></Property>
	</Analysis>
</BES>
